  "goodToKnow": "Zielstrebig means determined or single-minded in pursuing goals: zielstrebig arbeiten, eine zielstrebige Schülerin. It's a typical positive word in job references. Die Zielstrebigkeit is determination. Synonyms: entschlossen, ehrgeizig (ambitious), beharrlich. Compare zielgerichtet (targeted), used for measures rather than people. Opposite: ziellos."
